public datasets, fonts and TabPFN model weights retain their own licenses.
No model weights are redistributed. TabPFN-3.5 weights are downloaded by the
TabPFN package through Prior Labs' model-license acceptance flow.

Included production data: Auto MPG (R. Quinlan), UCI Machine Learning Repository,
https://doi.org/10.24432/C5859H, CC BY 4.0. Derived tables in demo/video/ include deliberately planted errors; answer keys
and attribution are preserved beside them. Other benchmark tables are fetched
by the reproduction scripts; their source pages specify their licenses.

Original measured benchmark artifacts are preserved for reproducibility.
Earlier machine-specific paths in stored artifacts were changed to relative
paths without changing measurements. The benchmark scope amendment records
the retained experimental scope and analysis corrections.

The video uses Inter and IBM Plex Mono; no font binaries are redistributed.
The product soundtrack is original generated music
with no sampled recordings. See demo/showcase/README.md for video provenance.
